{"seq":1,"slug":"git-version-control","title":"Git 与版本控制","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.68,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"git-与版本控制-简介\">Git 与版本控制 简介</h1><p>Git 是当今软件开发领域最广泛使用的分布式版本控制系统。从个人项目到数十万开发者协作的超大型仓库，Git 以其高效的分支模型、快照式存储和去中心化架构，成为代码管理的事实标准。深入理解 Git 的内部机制和高级用法，是每一位开发者提升工程效率的关键。</p>\n<p>本手册面向具有 Git 基础使用经验、希望系统化提升版本控制能力的软件开发者、团队负责人和 DevOps 工程师。无论你是想要理解 Git 底层原理的好奇者，还是在多人协作中频繁遇到冲突和历史管理难题的实战开发者，都能在这里找到清晰且深入的参考。</p>\n<p>全书共分五个章节，覆盖从底层原理到生态工具的完整知识体系：</p>\n<p>第一章&quot;基础与原理&quot;从 Git 内部数据结构入手，讲解对象模型、分支模型、合并与变基策略，以及 stash 和 worktree 等日常工具，帮助你建立对 Git 底层机制的深刻理解。</p>\n<p>第二章&quot;高级操作&quot;聚焦交互式变基、二分法调试、cherry-pick 与 revert 等进阶操作，以及 filter-repo 等历史重写工具，让你在复杂场景下游刃有余。</p>\n<p>第三章&quot;团队协作&quot;系统梳理远程仓库管理、Pull Request 工作流、冲突解决策略和 Code Review 实践，帮助团队建立高效规范的协作流程。</p>\n<p>第四章&quot;大仓库与规模化&quot;探讨子模块与子树、稀疏检出与部分克隆、Git Hooks 自动化以及大型仓库的性能调优，为 Monorepo 架构和规模化开发提供解决方案。</p>\n<p>第五章&quot;生态与工具&quot;介绍 GitHub Actions CI/CD、Git LFS 大文件管理、GPG/SSH 签名安全机制，以及 lazygit、tig 等效率工具，完善你的 Git 工具链。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序学习——先掌握基础原理，再深入高级操作，然后结合团队协作场景实践，最终在规模化和生态层面形成完整认知。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与原理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"git-internals","title":"Git 内部原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/git-internals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"branching-model","title":"分支模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/branching-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"merge-and-rebase","title":"合并与变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/merge-and-rebase"},{"seq":4,"slug":"stash-and-worktree","title":"暂存与工作树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/stash-and-worktree"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-operations","title":"高级操作","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interactive-rebase","title":"交互式变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/interactive-rebase"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bisect-and-blame","title":"二分法与追溯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/bisect-and-blame"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cherry-pick-and-revert","title":"精选与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/cherry-pick-and-revert"},{"seq":4,"slug":"filter-and-rewrite","title":"历史重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/filter-and-rewrite"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"collaboration","title":"团队协作","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"remote-and-fetch","title":"远程与拉取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/remote-and-fetch"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pull-request-workflow","title":"Pull Request 工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/pull-request-workflow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/conflict-resolution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"code-review-practices","title":"Code Review 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/code-review-practices"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"monorepo-and-scale","title":"大仓库与规模化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"submodules-and-subtrees","title":"子模块与子树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/submodules-and-subtrees"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-checkout","title":"稀疏检出与部分克隆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/sparse-checkout"},{"seq":3,"slug":"git-hooks","title":"Git Hooks 钩子机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/git-hooks"},{"seq":4,"slug":"performance-tuning","title":"性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/monorepo-and-scale/performance-tuning"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"ecosystem","title":"生态与工具","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"github-actions","title":"GitHub Actions 持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/github-actions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"git-lfs","title":"Git LFS 大文件存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/git-lfs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"signing-and-security","title":"签名与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/signing-and-security"},{"seq":4,"slug":"gui-and-tools","title":"GUI 与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/gui-and-tools"}]}]}